# ── what is committed, and what is not ────────────────────────────────────
#
#   cohorts/    COMMITTED. The frozen site assignment and discovery/validation
#               split. Redrawing them moves every downstream number.
#   genes/      COMMITTED. Curated gene sets.
#   figures/    COMMITTED. Rendered heatmaps, kept for sharing.
#   ipynb/      COMMITTED, and holds notebooks and nothing else.
#   src/        COMMITTED. R that is not a notebook.
#   reference/  COMMITTED. The earlier Nextflow scaffold, kept as the logic source.
#
#   data/       NOT committed. The GEO download, and data/run_artifacts/,
#               which holds everything a run can regenerate.

data/
endotypes-transcriptomics.tar.gz

# ipynb/ holds notebooks. Anything else that lands there is a stray.
ipynb/*.csv
ipynb/*.rds
ipynb/*.png
ipynb/*.pdf
ipynb/*.html
ipynb/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# R
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/

# macOS
.DS_Store
